  storyText: "Back Alley\n\nRain, trash, a flickering Kang Tao ad. The shard is still warm in your hand, and your personal link pings: UNKNOWN DATA - SLOT? Y/N.\n\nSomewhere behind you, boots.\n\n1. Slot the shard.\n2. Call Kaz the fixer.\n3. Run for the NCART station."
